tinacloud-project-status(1) -- List a project's status
======================================================

## DESCRIPTION

List the status of the given project.

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud project status`

## OPTIONS

  * `--project-id`:
    TinaCloud project ID

  * `--json`:
    Print the result as JSON

  * `--tina-dir`:
    Path to the tina folder (default "tina")

## EXAMPLES

	$ tinacloud project status \
		--project-id 1e1d3398-8255-4812-9f67-388993734a01

